OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be dry and
OL,6,Fbright with sunny spells. Cloud will
OL,7,Fspread in from the northwest during
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with rain following in
OL,9,Fthe north later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will be mostly
OL,12,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain in the
OL,13,Fnorth. The rain will spread towards
OL,14,Fthe southeast, overnight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FDry in the southeast at
OL,17,Ffirst, rain in the northwest will soon
OL,18,Fspread to all parts, becoming patchy
OL,19,Fand light by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
