OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FPatchy
OL,6,Flight rain or drizzle in the north and
OL,7,Fwest at first Sunday otherwise dry and
OL,8,Fbright into Tuesday. The chance of fog
OL,9,FMonday morning.
